格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 远程工作区插件：通过 SSH 连接一台或多台服务器，直接在 DSH 的 Web 界面里浏览文件、编辑代码、执行命令——体验类似 VS Code Remote-SSH，无需离开对话。","id":"gh:1335773827","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-remote-workspace","slug":"FYL1025/dsh-remote-workspace","topics":["deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin","plugin","remote-workspace","ssh","web-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 远程工作区插件：通过 SSH 连接一台或多台服务器，直接在 DSH 的 Web 界面里浏览文件、编辑代码、执行命令——体验类似 VS Code Remot"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ess (DSH) 远程工作区插件：通过 SSH 连接一台或多台服务器，直接在 DSH 的 Web 界面里浏览文件、编辑代码、执行命令——体验类似 VS Code Remote-SSH，无需离开对话。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🖥️ dsh-remote-workspace"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Remote Workspace for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** — browse files, edit code, and run commands on **o"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ne or more SSH servers** directly from the DSH web UI. Like VS Code Remote-SSH, without leaving the "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"H servers** directly from the DSH web UI. Like VS Code Remote-SSH, without leaving the conversation."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Multi-server connection management** (Settings → Remote Workspace): SSH alias (`~/.ssh/config` H"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ost) or host/port/user modes; switch connections anytime; config persists in browser localStorage\n- "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"**🔌 Connect / ⏹ Disconnect**: verify and hold/release the active server's connection state with one "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"click\n- **File tree browser**: lazy-loaded expand/collapse, hidden-files toggle, per-type icons, one"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"-click copy path\n- **Code editor**: line numbers + 👁 syntax-highlight preview (keywords/strings/comm"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ents/numbers/decorators) + ✏️ edit and save back to the server\n- **Command runner**: run any command"},{"id":"p6s7","text":" on the server (working directory follows the open file)\n- **Dock / Float dual modes**: docked besid"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"e the conversation (conversation reflows, draggable divider) / wide floating panel (up to 1400px)\n- "},{"id":"p6s9","text":"**Conversation-direct**: ask the agent in chat to operate on server files directly"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🥇 Why this plugin?"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Compared with other DSH SSH / remote-file-browser plugins:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Multi-server, not single-server** — add and switch any number of SSH connections (alias or host/"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"port/user); most similar plugins hard-code one server\n- **Zero-build, pure source** — no tsdown/type"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"rt build step; the published source *is* the running code, so it is easy to audit, fork, or extend\n-"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" **Dock / Float dual modes** — dock beside the conversation (auto-reflow + draggable divider) or one"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"-click widen to a 1400px floating panel; other panels usually just overlay the page\n- **Syntax highl"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ighting + line numbers** — IDE-like code reading (keywords / strings / comments / numbers / decorato"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"rs), not a plain textarea\n- **Persistent config** — connection settings survive page refresh (localS"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"torage)\n- **Reuses your local SSH** — works with existing `~/.ssh/config` aliases and keys; no passw"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ords are ever stored\n- **Built-in command runner** — run commands in the panel; the working director"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"y follows the open file\n- **Conversation-direct** — pairs with DSH agents: you can also just say \"ed"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"it this file on the server\" in chat\n- **Bilingual docs + MIT open source**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 📦 Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Requirements**: Node.js ≥ 18 · pnpm · a DSH profile (usually `web`)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Restart DSH** after install, then open **Settings → Remote Workspace**."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. **Settings → Remote Workspace** → add your server (SSH alias or host/port/user) and select it as "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"the active connection\n2. Click **🔌 Connect** to verify connectivity (it flips to ⏹ Disconnect on suc"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"cess)\n3. Click **📂 Open Workspace Panel** — the file browser appears beside the conversation\n4. Expa"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"nd directories, click a file:\n- **👁 Preview** — syntax highlighting\n- **✏️ Edit** — modify and click"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" **Save** to write back to the server\n5. Use the **command runner** at the bottom (e.g. `ls -la`, `p"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ython train.py`)\n6. Click **⇔ Widen** for the wide floating panel; drag its edge to resize"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## ⚠️ Prerequisites: SSH passwordless login (important)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin uses your **local SSH client** to reach servers, so **key-based passwordless login** must"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" be configured first:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. **Check for an existing key** — `ls ~/.ssh/` — or generate one: `ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C \"you@ex"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ample.com\"` (press Enter for defaults)\n2. **Add the public key to the server**:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"3. **(Recommended) Define an alias** in `~/.ssh/config` (Windows: `C:\\Users\\<you>\\.ssh\\config`):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"4. **Verify** — `ssh myserver` should log in **without asking for a password**."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🔒 Security"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- The plugin runs ssh commands with a **danger-full-access** policy — equivalent to you running ssh "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"yourself in a terminal; limited to commands issued by this plugin.\n- Connection settings (alias/host"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"/port/user) are stored in browser localStorage; **no passwords or private keys** are ever stored."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## ❓ FAQ"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Issue | Fix |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| ❌ Connection failed | Check host/port/user; confirm passwordless login works (`ssh <alias>`); retr"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"y |\n| Permission denied (publickey) | Public key not on the server — run `ssh-copy-id` or append to "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"`authorized_keys` |\n| Large file rejected | The plugin reads text files ≤ 2MB; ask the agent in chat"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" for bigger files |\n| Panel not visible after restart | Hard-refresh the page (Ctrl+Shift+R); ensure"},{"id":"p28s5","text":" the plugin is listed in `dsh plugin --profile web list` |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🤝 Feedback"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Found a bug or have an idea? Open an issue — contributions are welcome."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
